{"ID":"20240205153710-eap69sn","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153710-eap69sn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153710-eap69sn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206141033-50jdso1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162753-ii0ryud\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206141033-50jdso1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:141,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:141\u0026#125;","title":"血竭","type":"doc","updated":"20240902174247"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206141033-50jdso1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206141033-50jdso1","updated":"20240206141044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产索马里、埃塞俄比亚、阿拉伯半岛及印度等地。\n【性状】\t干燥树脂呈不定形的块状物，大小不等，表面有沟纹及因布包而遗留的布纹，赤褐色或紫褐色。质硬而脆，断面紫褐色至黑褐色，有玻璃样光泽，有时有小孔。用火燃之，冒烟呛鼻。研成粉末则呈鲜艳的深红色。无香气，味甘而咸，嚼之砂样。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，平。\n【功效】\t活血散瘀，定痛，止血生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240206141034-4cfd3q0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206141034-4cfd3q0","updated":"20240206141148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206141034-eb51x3l.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162753-ii0ryud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162753-ii0ryud","updated":"20240205162753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"血竭"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/血竭-20240205162753-r48rq61.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726115332-bypmgv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726115332-bypmgv3","updated":"20240726115425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 586px;","style":"width: 576px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 10-20240726115331-o5l7v72.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 576px;\" parent-style=\"width: 586px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 619px;","style":"width: 609px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 11-20240726115425-r360o5d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 609px;\" parent-style=\"width: 619px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726115206-bfqc8gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726115206-bfqc8gt","updated":"20240726115207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 388px;","style":"width: 378px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 8-20240726115207-zr0mk4r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 378px;\" parent-style=\"width: 388px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 860px;","style":"width: 850px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 7-20240726115123-p4au8ja.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 850px;\" parent-style=\"width: 860px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726114114-7zq3ogs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726114114-7zq3ogs","updated":"20240726114114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 578px;","style":"width: 568px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树-20240726114114-ql09fdv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 568px;\" parent-style=\"width: 578px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 2-20240726114243-q4fi99y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726114415-os4i794","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726114415-os4i794","updated":"20240726114458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 3-20240726114415-hvqqgmy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 634px;","style":"width: 624px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 4-20240726114458-9pcq9bo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 624px;\" parent-style=\"width: 634px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726114215-akb8axm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726114215-akb8axm","updated":"20240726114516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙血树 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙血树 1-20240726114215-cmkho42.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726113214-m7va27r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726113214-m7va27r","updated":"20240726114801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为棕榈科植物麒麟竭（又名龙血树）渗出的树脂经加工制成。"}]},{"ID":"20240726113440-peqbmgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726113440-peqbmgr","updated":"20240902174247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：龙血树受伤后会流出一种血色的液体，这种液体是一种树脂，呈深红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240726113853-tuows7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726113853-tuows7n","updated":"20240726113917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三注：龙血树生长缓慢，也是地球上最长寿的树木，生命周期可达八千年；"}]},{"ID":"20240726113215-3iv58zc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240726113215-3iv58zc"}},{"ID":"20240902174212-y3mzev9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-y3mzev9","updated":"20240902174220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：血竭"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-pv2ty5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-pv2ty5t","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血竭《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-s7u3dez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-s7u3dez","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】XuèJié"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-i5rlu6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-i5rlu6d","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】SANGUISDRAXONIS"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-f0qose5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-f0qose5","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】血竭花"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-s1d2ima","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-s1d2ima","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为棕榈科植物麒麟竭DaemonoropsdracoBlume．果实渗出的树脂经加工制成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-bzsvecj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-bzsvecj","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品略呈类圆四方形或方砖形，表面暗红粉，有光泽，附有因摩擦而成的红粉。质硬而脆，破碎面红色，研粉为砖红色。气微，味淡。在水中不溶，在热水中软化。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-g5qyal1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-g5qyal1","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-5tqj8i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-5tqj8i7","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）取本品粉末，置白纸上，用火隔纸烘烤即熔化，但无扩散的油迹，对光照视呈鲜艳的红色。以火燃烧则产生呛鼻的烟气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4m56j4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4m56j4x","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末约0.1g，加乙醚10ml，密塞，振摇10分钟，滤过，滤液作为供试品溶液。另取血竭对照药材0.1g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验,吸取供试品溶液、对照药材溶液及[含量测定〕项下血竭素高氯酸盐对照品溶液各10～20μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以氯仿-甲醇（19:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上显相同的橙色斑点；在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同的橙色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-wartl0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-wartl0c","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取本品粉末约0.5g，加乙醇10ml，密塞，振摇10分钟，滤过，滤液加稀盐酸5ml，混匀，析出棕黄色沉淀，放置后逐渐凝成棕黑色树脂状物。取树脂状物，用稀盐酸10ml分次充分洗涤，弃去洗液，加20％氢氧化钾溶液10ml，研磨，加氯仿5ml，移置分液漏斗中，振摇，氯仿层显红色，取氯仿层作为供试品溶液。另取血竭对照药材，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取供试品溶液与对照药材溶液各10～20μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以氯仿-甲醇（19:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同的橙色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-tirhd53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-tirhd53","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【含量测定】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-7vfjqtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-7vfjqtd","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"照高效液相色谱法（附录ⅥD）测定。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-i8cymva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-i8cymva","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"色谱条件与系统适用性试验用十八烷基硅烷键合硅胶为填充剂；乙腈-0.05mol/L磷酸二氢钠溶液（50:50）为流动相；检测波长为440nm；柱温40℃。理论板数按血竭素峰计算应不低于4000。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-vhuvab9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-vhuvab9","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对照品溶液的制备精密称取血竭素高氯酸盐对照品9mg，置50ml棕色量瓶中，加3％磷酸甲醇溶液使溶解并稀释至刻度，摇匀，精密量取1ml，置5ml棕色量瓶中，加甲醇至刻度，摇匀，即得（每1ml中含血竭素26μg）（血竭素重量＝血竭素高氯酸盐重量／1.377）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-0kyz9co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-0kyz9co","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"供试品溶液的制备取本品适量，研细，精密称取0.05～0.15g，置具塞试管中，精密加入3％磷酸甲醇溶液10ml，密塞，振摇3分钟，滤过，精密量取续滤液1ml，置5ml棕色量瓶中，加甲醇至刻度，摇匀，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-dlydf0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-dlydf0c","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"测定法分别精密吸取对照品溶液与供试品溶液各10μl，注入液相色谱仪，测定，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-7qeuq2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-7qeuq2x","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品含血竭素（C17H14O3）不得少于1.0％。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-nc8nhey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-nc8nhey","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，打成碎粒或研成细末。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-8cedoyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-8cedoyx","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、咸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-k073dha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-k073dha","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-6dkki9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-6dkki9v","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛瘀定痛，止血生肌。用于跌扑折损，内伤瘀痛；外伤出血不止。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-293lkj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-293lkj0","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：研末，1～2g，或入丸剂。外用：研末撒或入膏药用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-xzk5jkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-xzk5jkj","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-7h1khu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-7h1khu6","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）《全国中草药汇编》－－－商品血竭的植物来源复杂，除前述外，尚有龙舌兰科龙血树属植物柬埔寨龙血树DracaenacambodianaPierre；龙血树属植物龙血树DracaenaombetKotschy（东非洲）；豆科紫檀属植物龙血紫檀PterocarpusdracoL.（美洲）；大戟科巴豆属植物龙血巴豆CrotondracoSchlecht.（墨西哥）；同属木槿叶巴豆CrotonhibiscifoliusKunth（西班牙新格拉纳达产）及流脂巴豆CrotongossypiifoliusVahl[C.sanguifluusH.B.etK.Nov.]（新安达拉西亚产）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-5kbejkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-5kbejkr","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-ivo5xke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-ivo5xke","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血竭《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-msmzx2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-msmzx2v","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-nhujt0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-nhujt0h","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】XuèJié"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-dxuz96e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-dxuz96e","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】麒麟竭（《雷公炮炙论》），海蜡（侯宁极《药谱》），麒麟血（《圣惠方》），木血竭（《滇南本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-70klvn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-70klvn7","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为棕榈科植物麒麟竭的果实及树干中的树脂。采取果实，置蒸笼内蒸煮，使树脂渗出；或取果实捣烂，置布袋内，榨取树脂，然后煎熬成糖浆状，冷却凝固成块状。亦有将树干砍破或钻以若干小孔，使树脂自然渗出，凝固而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-ckda9k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-ckda9k2","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-jwuk0a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-jwuk0a1","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麒麟竭，又名：渴留（《唐本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4vm30pz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4vm30pz","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生常绿藤本，长达10～20米，茎被叶鞘并遍生尖刺。羽状复叶在枝梢互生，在下郎有时近对生；小叶互生，线状披针形，长约20～30厘米，宽约3厘米，先端锐尖，基部狭，脉3出平行；叶柄及叶轴具锐刺。肉穗花序，开淡黄色的冠状花，单性，雌雄异株；花被6，排成2轮；雄花雄蕊6，花药长锥形；雌花有不育雄蕊6，雌蕊1，瓶状，子房略呈卵状，密被鳞片，花柱短，柱头3深裂。果实核果状，卵状球形，径约2～3厘米，赤褐色，具黄色鳞片，果实内含深亦色的液状树脂，常由鳞片下渗出，干后如血块样。种子1枚。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-vcd4hs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-vcd4hs6","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】分布印度尼西亚、马来西亚、伊朗；我国广东、台湾亦有种植。主产马来西亚、印度尼西亚、伊朗等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-zarlj6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-zarlj6j","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-dmunnss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-dmunnss","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥树脂呈不定形的块状物，大小不等，表面有沟纹及因布包而遗留的布纹，赤褐色或紫褐色。质硬而脆，断面紫褐色至黑褐色，有玻璃样光泽，有时有小孔。用火燃之，冒烟呛鼻。研成粉末则呈鲜艳的深红色。无香气，味甘而咸，嚼之砂样。以外表色黑如铁，研末红如血，燃之其烟呛鼻者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-jahwg2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-jahwg2h","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，尚有索科特拉血竭，系龙舌兰科植物龙血树的树脂，呈小泪滴状或碎块状，长不过2厘米，断面玻璃样，薄片酒红色。加热时无苯甲酸气味。产于东非。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-kxl6s2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-kxl6s2u","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我国云南发现一种山铁树，又名：柬埔寨龙血树，其树脂与上述品种作用相同。植物形态参见\"山铁树叶\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-cn8fpej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-cn8fpej","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】是一种树脂酯及血竭树脂鞣醇的混合物，约含57～82％；另含无定形的血竭白素约2.5％，黄色血竭树脂烃约14％，不溶性树脂0.3％，植物性渣滓18.4％，赭朴吩0.03％，灰分8.3％。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-mmbulyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-mmbulyz","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】抗真菌作用。血竭水浸剂（1：2）在试管内对堇色毛癣菌、石膏样毛癣菌、许兰氏黄癣菌等多种致病真菌有不同程度的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-veex78n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-veex78n","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-vt9h01p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-vt9h01p","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拭去灰尘，敲成小块，于冬季干燥天气，放在石灰坛内使燥，然后乘脆研末。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-qh2wesx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-qh2wesx","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮炙论》：\"麒麟竭，欲使，先研作粉，重筛过，勿与众药同捣，化作飞尘也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-rpa8ivu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-rpa8ivu","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-ji766yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-ji766yv","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-5mqif1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-5mqif1y","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮炙论》：\"味微咸甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-qz3f6hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-qz3f6hk","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《唐本草》：\"味甘咸，平，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-49b0d38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-49b0d38","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草蒙筌》：\"味辛咸，气平，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4b8an1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4b8an1v","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-xmldcqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-xmldcqd","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4ah0unr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4ah0unr","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"手足厥阴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-z0wokph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-z0wokph","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入足厥阴，手少阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-69ktwyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-69ktwyf","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草新编》：\"入肾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-dej3l14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-dej3l14","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-pnnbr72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-pnnbr72","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"散瘀定痛，止血生肌。治跌打折损，内伤瘀痛；外伤出血不止，瘰疬，臁疮溃久不合。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-nw11t7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-nw11t7v","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《唐本草》：\"主五脏邪气，带下，止痛，破积血，金创生肉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-1flsiqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-1flsiqq","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《海药本草》：\"主打伤折损，一切疼痛，补虚及血气搅刺，内伤血聚，并宜酒服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-m8o4obq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-m8o4obq","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"治一切恶疮疥癣久不合者，敷。此药性急，亦不可多使，却引脓。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4qoumiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4qoumiy","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④王好古：\"补心包络，肝血不足。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-nu6yklf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-nu6yklf","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"散滞血诸痛，妇人血气，小儿瘈疭。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-vrb9une","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-vrb9une","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：研末，1～3分；或入丸剂。外用：研末撒或入膏药内敷贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-cghaduq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-cghaduq","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-m4wnc2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-m4wnc2b","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《日华子本草》：\"得密陀僧良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-cups64e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-cups64e","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"凡血病无瘀积者不必用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-m5axx6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-m5axx6g","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-lt0fusy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-lt0fusy","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治伤损筋骨，疼痛不可忍：麒麟血一两，没药一两，当归一两（锉，微炒），白芷二两，赤芍药一两，桂心一两。捣细罗为散，每服，以温酒调下二钱，日三、四服。（《圣惠方》麒麟血散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-cgnq50o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-cgnq50o","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治腹中血块：血竭、没药、滑石、牡丹皮（同煮过）各一两。为末，醋糊丸，梧桐子大，服之。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-5hh3j36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-5hh3j36","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治产后败血冲心，胸满气喘：真血竭，研为细末，温酒调服。（《朱氏集验医方》血竭散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-t6zo44k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-t6zo44k","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治鼻衄：血竭、蒲黄等分。为末，吹之。（《医林集要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-ivtm9a2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-ivtm9a2","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治瘰疬已破，脓水不止者：血竭（炒）二钱半，大枣二十个（烧为灰），干地黄半两（别为末）。上三味，都细研如粉，以津唾调贴疮上。（《博济方》血竭散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-a2x30b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-a2x30b2","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治一切不测恶疮，年深不愈：血竭一两，铅丹半两（炒紫色）。上二味，捣研为散，先用盐畅洗疮后贴之。（《圣济总录》血竭散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-xnc7kum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-xnc7kum","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治臁疮不合：血竭末敷之，以干为度。（《济急仙方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-rrsf3kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-rrsf3kg","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治痔漏疼痛不可忍：血竭，为细末，用自津唾调涂，频为妙。（《杨氏家藏方》血竭散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-tg9f92r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-tg9f92r","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治嵌甲疼痛：血竭末调敷之。（《医林集要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-1bkyfwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-1bkyfwv","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治白虎风，走转疼痛，两膝热肿：麒麟竭一两，硫黄一两（细研）。捣罗为散，研令匀，以温酒调下一钱。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-h2ssov4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-h2ssov4","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】内服血竭引起过敏反应：某患者内服血竭后发生周身瘙痒，四肢及胸背部皮肤潮红，压之退色，手脚有明显的血管神经性水肿，两侧脚面和小腿接连部各有4x4厘米的大水泡1个，周围有豆粒大小水泡数十个，颜面发红，眼皮水肿，呼吸迫促，头晕等；检查：体温腋下38.9℃，脉搏92次／分，呼吸24次／分，血压80／65毫米汞柱，余无异常。经抗过敏治疗而愈。随后即用原来内服之血竭作斑贴试验，并用黄酒（因患者用黄洒冲服血竭发生过敏）和蒸馏水作对照，结果在血竭斑贴部出现4x4厘米范围的红色丘疹，局部瘙痒，全身无反应，24小时后丘疹消退；而黄酒及蒸馏水所作的对照局部皮肤均呈阴性。因此，临床应用血竭内服尚不能认为完全无虞，必要时需先作过敏试验，免致不良后果。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-f3aof6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-f3aof6b","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-klo8sj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-klo8sj8","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血竭《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-sdlducd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-sdlducd","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-luqcd1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-luqcd1o","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《雷公炮炙论》：凡使，勿用海母血，真似骐驎竭，只是味咸并腥气。骐驎竭味微咸甘，似栀子气是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-np4803a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-np4803a","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《唐本草》：骐驎竭，树名渴留，喻如蜂造蜜，斫取用之，《吴录》谓之赤胶者。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-arlgory","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-arlgory","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《开宝本草》：别本注云，紫矿、骐驎竭，二物同条，功效全别。紫矿色赤而黑，其叶大如盘，矿从叶上出。骐驎竭，色黄而赤，叶如樱桃，三角，竭从木中出。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-yw88z0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-yw88z0x","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草图经》：骐驎竭，今出南方诸国及广州。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-nst26xv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-nst26xv","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240902174212-zdd4g6t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-zdd4g6t","updated":"20240902174212"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240902174212-s92qf9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-s92qf9n","updated":"20240902174212"}}]}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-d2wy9u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-d2wy9u0","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】XuèJié"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-9wo9a5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-9wo9a5u","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Dragon'sBlood"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-gfflcju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-gfflcju","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】骐驎竭、海蜡、麒麟血、木血竭"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-cbx66z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-cbx66z8","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-xv4hhyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-xv4hhyp","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为棕榈科植物麒麟竭果实和藤茎中的树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-llidy8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-llidy8i","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：DaemonoropsdracoBl."}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-ffetg8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-ffetg8o","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：采取果实，置蒸笼内蒸煮，使树脂渗出；或取果实捣烂，置布袋内，榨取树脂，然后煎熬成糖浆状，冷却凝固成块状。亦有将树干砍破或钻以若干小孔，使树脂自然渗出，凝固而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-q29lx0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-q29lx0l","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】麒麟竭，多年生常绿藤本，长达10-20m。茎被叶鞘并遍生尖刺。羽状复叶在枝梢互生，在下部有时近对生；小叶互生，线状披针形，长约20-30cm，宽约3cm，先端锐尖，基部狭，脉3出平行；叶柄及叶轴具锐刺。肉穗花序，开淡黄色的冠状花，单性，雌雄异株；花被6，排成2轮；雄花雄蕊6，花药长锥形；雌花有不育雄蕊6，雌蕊1，瓶状，子房略呈卵状，密被鳞片，花柱短，柱头3深裂。果实核果状，卵状球形，径约2-3cm，赤褐色，具黄色鳞片，果实内含深赤色的液状树脂，常由鳞片下渗出，干后如血块样。种子1颗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-vzomu8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-vzomu8z","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-5bnmi22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-5bnmi22","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：分布于印度尼西亚、马来西亚伊朗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4mfar1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4mfar1n","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：我国台湾、广东有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-dran5tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-dran5tr","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4szbque","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4szbque","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别（1）进口加工血竭（手牌、皇冠牌）：略呈扁圆四方形，大小、重量不一，一般直径6-8cm，厚约4cm，重120-150g。表面暗红色或黑红色，有光泽，常附有因磨擦而成的红粉。底部平圆，顶端有包扎成型时形成的纵折纹。质硬脆易碎。破碎面黑红色，光亮，研粉则为血红色。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-1y75ffj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-1y75ffj","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）原装血竭呈扁圆形、圆形或不规则块状，大小不等。表面红褐色、红色、砖红色。断面有光泽。研粉为血红色。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-93mx3td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-93mx3td","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】麒麟竭果实表面鳞片所分泌的枝脂含血竭红素(dracorubin)，血竭素(dracorhodin)，去甲基血竭红素(nordracorubin)，去甲基血竭素(nordracorhodin)，(2S)-5-甲氧基-6-甲基黄烷-7-醇[(2S)-5-methoxyflavan-7-ol]，(2S)-5-甲氧基蓼烷-7-醇[(2S)-5-methoxyflavan-7-ol]，2，4-二羟基-5-甲基-6-甲氧基耳酮(2,4-dihydroxy-5-methyl-6-methoxychalcone)，血竭黄烷(dracoflavan)A，血竭二氧杂庚醚(dracooxepine)，另含海松酸(pimaricacid)，异海松酸(isopimaricacid)，松香酸(abieticacid)，去氢松香酸(dehydroabieticacid)，山达海松酸(sandaracopimaricacid)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-yw3vbpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-yw3vbpl","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-d1irt11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-d1irt11","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.抗真菌作用：血竭水浸剂（1：2）在试营内对堇色毛癣菌、石膏样毛癣菌、许兰氏黄癣菌等多种致病真菌有不同程度的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-qav6ql2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-qav6ql2","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.止血作用：动物实验证明，本品能显着缩短家兔血浆再钙化时间，从而增加其凝血作用。对血液流变性的影响：血竭水煎醇沉液（1:1）0.5ml/kg肌内注射连续3周，使兔血红细胞压积减少，红细胞及血小板电泳时间缩短，但对全血粘度比值及血浆粘度比值无明显影响。对血小板聚集功能的影响：血竭水煎醇沉液（1:1）0.1ml体外试验，加于0.5ml富血小板血浆内，对ADP诱导的血小板聚集有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-hebi9iu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-hebi9iu","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-7p7p0zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-7p7p0zi","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别（1）取本品颗粒置纸上，用大火烘烤则熔化，但无扩散的油迹，对光照视呈鲜艳的血红色，以火燃烧则发生呛鼻烟气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-z78kj7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-z78kj7h","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末少许，放在试管个加热熔融，即是暗红色，并有香气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-x02esaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-x02esaf","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取本品粉末少许，放在水中振摇，粉末个溶解，水不染色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-ialbjfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-ialbjfp","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）取本品粉末少许，加95%热乙醇溶解，加盐酸10滴，再加水10-15滴，有棕黄色沉淀（血竭黄素）。如掺有红土、氧化铁、红粉、松香及植物性杂质，则95%乙醇不能完全溶解。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-jxno6ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-jxno6ck","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"商品规格，通常分原装血竭和加工血竭。原装血竭为原产地印度尼西严经初加工所得的团块，一般不含外加辅粒，质量较优，目前进口已不多见。加工血竭为原装血竭在新加坡掺入辅料经加工而成，并多用布袋扎成类圆四方形，底部贴有手牌、竽冠牌等金色商标。时口血竭主要为加工血竭，过去按商标分规格，现改用按质量分两个等级。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-c73bzys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-c73bzys","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拭去灰尘，敲成小块，于冬季干燥天气，放在石除去杂质，灰坛内使燥，然后乘脆研末。《雷公炮炙论》:骐驎竭，欲使，先研作粉，重筛过，勿与众药同捣，化作飞尘也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-1dnea8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-1dnea8a","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味甘；咸；性平；小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-4xk8w5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-4xk8w5w","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】心；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-tch6l82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-tch6l82","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】散瘀定痛；止血；生肌敛疮。主跌打损伤；内伤瘀痛；痛经；产后瘀阻腹痛；外伤出血不止；瘰疬；臁疮溃久不合及痔疮"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-nsc5tvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-nsc5tvp","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：研末，1-1.5g，或入丸剂。外用：适量，研末调敷或入膏药内敷贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-dhor192","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-dhor192","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】凡无瘀血者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-icrjvys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-icrjvys","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】1.七厘散(《良方集腋》)，活血散瘀，止痛止血，主治跌打损伤，筋断骨折之瘀血肿痛，或刀伤出积压，并治一切无名肿毒，烧伤烫伤等。2.麒麟血散(《圣惠方》)，主治伤损筋骨，疼痛不可忍者。3.血竭散(《圣济总录》)，主治一切恶疮，年深不愈。4.血竭散(《杨氏家藏方》)，主治痔漏疼痛不可忍。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-fsq0kkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-fsq0kkh","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-awa251j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-awa251j","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《唐本草》主五脏邪气，带下，心痛，破积血，金创生肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-ct13mlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-ct13mlf","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《海药本草》：主打伤折损，一切疼痛，补虚及血气搅刺，内伤血聚，并宜酒服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-5kgtkva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-5kgtkva","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《日华子本草》：治一切恶疮疥癣久不合者，敷。此药性急，亦不可多使，却引脓。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-fzb35pt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-fzb35pt","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.王好古：补心包络，肝血不足。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-e2selgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-e2selgy","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：散滞血诸痛，妇人血气，小儿瘛瘲。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-w8xk94q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-w8xk94q","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《纲目》：骐驎竭，木之脂液，如人之膏血，其味甘咸而走血，盖手足厥阴药也。肝与心包皆主血故尔。河间刘氏云，血竭除血痛，为和血之圣药是矣。乳香、没药，虽主血病，而兼入气分，此则专于血分者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-75n1o6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-75n1o6c","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草经疏》：骐驎竭，甘主补，咸主消，散瘀血、生新血之要药。故主破积血金疮，止痛生肉，主五脏邪气者，即邪热气也。带下者，湿热伤血分所致也。甘咸能凉血除热，故悉主之。苏恭主心腹卒痛，李珣以之治伤折打损，一切疼痛，血气搅刺，内伤血聚者，诚为此耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-l5iqh54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-l5iqh54","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本经逢原》：血竭，助阳药中同乳香、没药用之者，取以调和血气，而无留滞壅毒之患。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174212-lt7hbo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174212-lt7hbo8","updated":"20240902174243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174213-n5wwawa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902174213-n5wwawa","updated":"20240902174243"}},{"ID":"20240902174215-37svr8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174215-37svr8h","updated":"20240902174243"}}]}